      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/08/us/politics/hakeem-jeffries-house-democrats-speaker.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 10:00:12 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/06/multimedia/00dc-jeffries-flqb/00dc-jeffries-flqb-mediumSquareAt3X-v2.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/06/multimedia/00dc-jeffries-flqb/00dc-jeffries-flqb-mediumSquareAt3X-v2.jpg" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/06/multimedia/00dc-jeffries-flqb/00dc-jeffries-flqb-mediumSquareAt3X-v2.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Hakeem Jeffries, in Line to Become House Speaker, Promises Bold Agenda" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The man in line to be the first Black speaker is a reserved moderate seen by activists on the left as too timid to take on President Trump. He says he’s “strongly positioned” to get things done.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
